# Finance: Expense report review

Load examples/business/data/expense_report.txt as Expense Report
Alias Expense Report as Report

Find total amount and save as total_amount
Find receipt count and save as receipt_count

manual_review equals false

If total_amount is missing
  manual_review equals true

If receipt_count is missing
  manual_review equals true

total_amount must be at most 2000
receipt_count must be at least 1

If manual_review is true
  decision equals "needs review"
Otherwise
  decision equals "approved"

Route decision to finance_expense_queue
